# ♻️ Smart Bin Management System

<div align="center">

![Project Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Active_Development-brightgreen)
![Tech Stack](https://img.shields.io/badge/Stack-MERN%20%2F%20Next.js-blue)
![Hackathon](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hackathon-IIT_Kharagpur_Techmania_2026-orange)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-ISC-green)

An end-to-end, IoT-powered Smart Waste Management platform built with **Next.js 14**, **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **MongoDB Atlas**. Developed for the **IIT Kharagpur Techmania 2026** hackathon, this platform enables real-time waste telemetry monitoring, automated officer dispatch, dual-verification task resolution, and gamified field operations.

</div>

---

## 🏗️ System Architecture & Workflow Flowchart

Below is the complete architectural flow showing real-time data movement across the IoT telemetry simulator, backend API, MongoDB Atlas cloud database, secure JWT authentication, and dual frontends (Admin Dashboard & Officer Portal):

